"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThe story begins with Busan in 2063 as the background.  \nTime travel to the past becomes possible, but it is dangerous enough to risk one's life.  \nIn a world where the gap between the rich and the poor has become wider, the rich buy people who will risk their lives to go on a time travel with money.  \nThe rich sometimes send people on time travel for important work, but they also send them on life-risking time travel because they miss the taste of  they tasted in the past.  \n\nThe protagonist ends up on a life-risking time travel to learn the  (beef bone soup) recipe of the past.  \n\nA bizarre murder case occurs in the time of the past, and it seems to be intertwined with people from the future.  \n\nThe immersion of the novel is insane.  "